# Initialization Compendium for Brazilian Portuguese translations of gnu.org articles.
#
# This compendium is created manually to fill strings not satisfied by the
# master and compendium (in /server/gnun/compendia/). This content should be
# placed in here, and not in master and compendium files because:
#
#  - master: changes in this file forces changes in all translation files in
#            www repository, and also fuzzy strings are ignored. So strings
#            here are only for starting a translation but should be edited
#            right after its generation.
#
#  - compendium: this file is generated automatically by GNUN, which is the
#                system that manages translation in www.gnun.org. So there
#                is no point in edit a file that may be edited anytime will
#                be programmatically regenerated.
#
